  "title": "When Consulting Costs More Than Software",
  "summary": "Every rollout platform starts with a subscription price. That number is easy to compare across vendors, so it’s the one most buying committees anchor on. What’s harder to see upfront is the second bill that shows up after go-live: the ongoing consulting spend required to actually use the thing you bought. For some teams, that […]",
